tests/golden/check/fixedbugs-a-lend-laundered-through-a-helper.hero:32:21: error[lend_needs_a_header]: `.cstr()` lends a `str` to C for one call, and it may stand only as an argument of a function declared in an `extern` group — here the callee is this program's own, and no declaration of this program can say what becomes of the pointer
